Blackboard (Text fork)
======================

This plugin is a fork of **Blackboard** by James Wolensky, at upstream version
1.2.1 (https://github.com/jameswolensky/obsidian-blackboard).

Upstream work is Copyright (c) James Wolensky and is distributed under the MIT
License; the full text is in LICENSE and applies unchanged to this fork.

Fork additions (text tool with a `.blackboard-text.json` sidecar, Q/E/T tool
hotkeys, drag-a-rectangle drawing-area insertion, and a set of rendering and
input performance fixes) are Copyright (c) Tatyana and are released under the
same MIT License.

The fork changes the plugin id to `blackboard-text` so it can be installed
alongside upstream Blackboard. The `.blackboard` file extension, the
`blackboard-view` view type and every `blackboard-*` CSS class are deliberately
unchanged, so drawings remain interchangeable with upstream.

Bundled third-party code:
  - perfect-freehand (MIT), Steve Ruiz
  - iro.js (MPL 2.0), James Daniel
